BikeRoute_House1_EventScript_Phildy_Text_0:
# 6 "data/maps/BikeRoute_House1/scripts.pory"
	.string "Oh, hello! The name's Phildy. I live here.\p"
	.string "You've met Kasmi next door, I take it? I\n"
	.string "met him the week before he left on that\l"
	.string "big trip - five minutes in and he was\l"
	.string "already describing mountain routes. I\l"
	.string "thought: this man is either completely\l"
	.string "mad or completely free. Turned out to\l"
	.string "be both.$"

BikeRoute_House1_EventScript_Phildy_Text_1:
# 7 "data/maps/BikeRoute_House1/scripts.pory"
	.string "About half a year in I went to find him.\n"
	.string "Three connections and a cargo ship\l"
	.string "later, I did. Found him somewhere in the\l"
	.string "back of beyond, fixing that motorcycle\l"
	.string "in the rain without a care in the world.\p"
	.string "I stayed two weeks, wrote to him for a\n"
	.string "year after that, and somewhere in all\l"
	.string "those letters I must have said the\l"
	.string "right thing, because eventually he\l"
	.string "wrote back: I'm coming home.$"

BikeRoute_House1_EventScript_Phildy_Text_2:
# 8 "data/maps/BikeRoute_House1/scripts.pory"
	.string "I won't say I talked him into it. But I\n"
	.string "won't say I didn't either.\p"
	.string "And now here we are - him fixing bikes\n"
	.string "next door, me right here. He likes to say\l"
	.string "this place is too small for him. Maybe.\l"
	.string "But it fits us just fine.$"
